[Deleted by Act 3 of 2025 wef 29/01/2026]
“Restructuring Adviser”, in relation to a company (in simplified debt restructuring), means a person appointed under section 72D(1) to be the Restructuring Adviser of the company;
[Act 3 of 2025 wef 29/01/2026]
“simplified debt restructuring programme” means the programme established in section 72C.
