(g)the information and documents to be furnished by a debtor to the Official Assignee relating to the debtor’s property, debts and other financial affairs;
(h)the convening and conduct of, and the participation of a debtor and the debtor’s creditors in and their respective obligations at, meetings held under Parts 14 and 15;
