(o)the grant and renewal of licences of licensed insolvency practitioners;
(p)the requirements applicable to licensed insolvency practitioners;
(q)the electronic submission of documents and forms to the Official Assignee or the Official Receiver;
(r)the lodging or registration of documents and the time and manner of submission of documents for lodging or registration;
